unverifiable tasks</a> that require judgement means much work remains for p=
eople to do.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Georgia, serif;">=
I am fortunate to have many friends across Silicon Valley and beyond, whom =
I meet and sometimes collaborate with and who help keep me sharp at the cut=
ting edge of AI. I know that not everyone has similar opportunities, which =
is why I treasure in-person events like AI Dev.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Georgia, serif;">=
AI Dev New York 2026 will focus on the <a  href=3D"https://info.deeplearnin=
g.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF623q=
