vbpJFVwW4smFy516NJb_f2mPv9l04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0=
" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"n5QcK3Xg" target=3D"_blank">subagents</a>, but it d=
elegates work to them only when instructed. Sakana=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"htt=
ps://info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW=
8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF623qgz0W8wLKSR6lZ3mwW93qldR1j68CcW6VVk7T6GCfv0TWsBw96zScLW=
86hCq14s4_qwN3LN_81jkjSVW2GLVZl69FmBdN2cPpw5qD0KtW2y3Bf78NbRDGW1g_ZNY455n0S=
W7PNB-g4BdtFhW4fxP0C87Rw7dW2VFV8r2kxvkvW4TsV4c1j2JY1W5WRbQh1ZzZZkW69KzKs2Fq=
QH6VBM7v12DTFhcW6H18V94qDTk-W6Sg4K38z75PpW4tmFfv9f-dzLVt0cch8-66MpW6lcT2P3h=
cr6PW4jjsQj3wX48dN1J824YH0SkDW4gsHrw5bqp8nW7l2kpf5SR8--W9g1zyK1yHzZMV3hjRP1=
Tk9sNW2XMCXR3D_Ljmf7-MQ7v04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" =
data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"qSzVUv7R" target=3D"_blank">Fugu</a> takes this logic=
 one step further, using a dedicated orchestrator model that can call model=
s from Google, OpenAI, or Anthropic at each step. All these efforts show th=
at the best model for a coding task may turn out to be two or more models w=
orking together.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>We=E2=80=99re thinking: </strong>Goog=
le has made three very capable new models available within the last month. =
We can all be thankful for this rapid pace of progress.</p>
