s-cos-general-type=3D"widget" data-hs-cos-type=3D"rich_text"><h1 style=3D"m=
argin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height:125%; font-s=
ize:32px; font-weight:bold">llama.cpp Makes It Official</h1>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">llama.cpp, an open source software package th=
at helps users run AI language models locally, finally reached version 1.0 =
after more than three years in development. The milestone signals that its =
developers consider it mature and stable enough for a major release.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>What=E2=80=99s new:</strong> The llam=
a.cpp team at Hugging Face released <a  href=3D"https://info.deeplearning.a=
i/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF5M3qgz0=
W7Y8-PT6lZ3psN3L4ld8KVwSbW6sc-d35gMm7JV9cmqq8sT_7cW2w9m0N3YzjKbW1-4Kx76ZMJv=
PW4177tD2Qc1q6W6rVPph1xm9YhW22wTK97BLg--W5MBvq-82DbccV-FS8G5thCJ0N3h35wmjnX=
V0W2K_0Qh3ZStqJW30pZyS3QZ9CzW6zTQZR5yDHNWW2JfLP034JwDZW44LwRS5-1k7SW7nGV041=
5NMTNN2lHJQvTVzn2W28v9xq73TdMfW8FLFc56pbqZkW96MrbP2P4xmkW8YJcmB9cnNQjW5F77G=
k2HdmVdW75f6fH1v6TKtVMTxZ85LDnNWW88yL5S4KFDpzf3jJ2Bq04" style=3D"color:#237=
b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"H3YYm+Hq" target=3D"_blank=
">version 1.0.0 of llama.cpp</a> and of ggml, the library that performs its=
 underlying math. The release shows that llama.cpp is still widely used and=
 under active development, and that local AI is arguably more popular than =
ever. The new package adds support for several new models, including Kimi-K=
3.1 Pro, a text-to-speech feature for its built-in server, and a redesigned=
 chat interface.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>How it works:</strong> Georgi Gergano=
v <a href=3D"https://info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV=
0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF4T5nR3bW69t95C6lZ3lHW9kgD4f8T7k7DW6L1vt010=
3223W2-l3G030PrFfVNjFgq17b2YYW6769m44h9zc9W65rDyt6c60BtW1HtSyr34-cvBW7VP03L=
8n7jdCW814HyP6YHB7sV2qWCp6ZxbCjW3lx2JL885jKhW9h4Gm87rd3lKW6nVLZ015y1VjW5Ctv=
qP2-krjcW422tg36Vq5g3W6Q7HbZ80ttrFW1Q3lSB9cB4qJW6ktMRR5rKk0LW8qf9zF3mzPKQW7=
yyCPR6Jl7MdW42TZvq4zbhbxW3yTnMh1KGr3MN3jgWn0PF6N-W6h2NHP45q5tMN56ygfjgX3kmW=
8Hxwrx2NNc8fW5D8Mtk34Lnt3W6v75-s85GSNmW4p1J_Y8RGcJqW8fR-Lv60bSNmW26TRsB4K7m=
VKW7K5QWJ844Pj2W5-CHs_4X7cGbW1tXPs75JtD2gW7K7PJS82w0PwW4zcLGM2VN6h1f35y_mF0=
4" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"J2wn=
08tF" target=3D"_blank">started</a> llama.cpp in March 2023, about a week a=
fter Meta=E2=80=99s first LLaMA language model <a href=3D"https://info.deep=
learning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8=
rPF623qgz0W8wLKSR6lZ3lCW47LRwV2D-rF9W2BKVf_6G0S7mW73-ky11CQGjpN2nvS6DQR--NW=
5mgxH6439R-1W6pvHDt7LHHFdW5ZL_bR380SjfW2Fl9h27tmRQlW1DMqzw7jh5r2W4sclPK5gLf=
BLW37VXj11rZcVMW1PMn8C1wQhGVW8qHXd16Zs_YTVnx3Mq6lCNvvW4KfZMT8XGqGLW3ZK8r46G=
1vZ_W835H8S53l9vRW2ZlVhk7CvH3bV4-Wf611Xm5tV8zTxs3JkD8wW1tcnwc1FJhB_W5s-kPC7=
1gJg8W4J7ZwX2kjjF7W1vMfLq64Ns8dW1V_q8K7--mN3W223dPg4807x6W8FW2b61vSmzFW6ggg=
Xs1J-dLff7vQtJK04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-li=
nk-id-v2=3D"7C4uDGuJ" target=3D"_blank">leaked</a> online. Gerganov wrote i=
t as a plain C/C++ program, compiled to run directly on a computer=E2=80=99=
s processor. Meta=E2=80=99s own code for running LLaMA required Python, the=
 PyTorch framework, CUDA, and an Nvidia graphics chip. Gerganov=E2=80=99s v=
ersion had no dependencies and could run on a MacBook or any other machine,=
 regardless of whether it had a specific GPU. Llama.cpp has been in use eve=
r since, powering apps like <a href=3D"https://info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc=
/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF5s3qgz0W7lCdLW6l=
Z3npN7NgjCymdVG8W97nWxp8Ct2DqW6M11Qk7nLLtLW8QfL_13BwNpCW2sgQfL8s7r5DW1y6MnM=
28KnvlVGqNZ153swHWW6p55kR6dZdsnW4PX8nh64XKp9W2kbGQk2S9LlbN3sxFq39VXF3VCHyKQ=
1gkxFtW5z2G5l3WhFYQW5-sxMb5qpp8-W69Qr5h7hNt_LW67TfNZ4S3LmYW7PSGbz93P8Q5W876=
Dp61PW87tN11589p8rK0CW4tmdZl7-Vl_NW2YYQFx63Y4X1W3mBsjk57_FxpVSLjrK3H3tzjW23=
FhVl3mp9NLf8WvZvM04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-=
link-id-v2=3D"buyGRnZK" target=3D"_blank">Ollama</a> and <a href=3D"https:/=
/info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwH=
kG5XSKyyN8rPF5s3qgz0W7lCdLW6lZ3p5W8--8Qy3hsbgtW2K5LSp3SvxTcW3fk2Nj4p7QrDW8F=
FF0S4HtN97W8Nl3hZ3X1NNxW79Jn4f4GqV5xW3TnSK17HLR47W651Xnr2SvxmmVDswH83hMkpPW=
3rkV5B5p3GqxN6VKLmbmsKQKN27TLXdw--RLW1kMp112wLfd7W18kThk3HS5S5W2sbT-74h2JrX=
W3Rt8xJ3XlR05W6PGTbG7gWH0VN65CQGlmYRS0W5-YR8W15-PMQW2cj-9S8Kw8PPW8Pg70w1-Ll=
mXW4YMSH41p26WYW4PVl5p4ttXZ-W6vwNJW49Snhkf25Ddg-04" style=3D"color:#237b94"=
 data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"sSYacbWF" target=3D"_blank">LM=
 Studio</a> that likewise help run local AI models on ordinary machines.</p=
>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While it=E2=80=99s perhaps best known for run=
ning AI models on laptops, llama.cpp can perform inference on hardware that=
 ranges from servers to edge machines. The project supports =E2=80=9Cmore t=
han 150 architecture variants,=E2=80=9D the team says.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">llama.cpp loads models stored in GGUF, a file=
 format designed to load quickly. Hugging Face hosts thousands of models co=
mpatible with llama.cpp.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The software relies heavily on quantization, =
which shrinks a model by storing its weights (the numbers that encode what =
it learned) at lower precision, for instance as 4-bit instead of 32-bit num=
bers. Quantized models require less memory and often run faster, sometimes =
at a cost in accuracy.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The ggml library interacts with different kin=
ds of hardware through separate backends, modules written for specific chip=
s or programming standards. These include CUDA for Nvidia GPUs, Metal for A=
pple chips, and the cross-vendor Vulkan standard, as well as backends for o=
rdinary CPUs.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">A bundled server accepts requests in formats =
modeled on OpenAI=E2=80=99s and Anthropic=E2=80=99s APIs, so many apps writ=
ten for cloud models can use a local model instead. The project makes =E2=
=80=9Cno strong claims of compatibility=E2=80=9D with OpenAI=E2=80=99s spec=
ification but says the server =E2=80=9Csuffices to support many apps.=E2=80=
=9D</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>Behind the news:</strong> llama.cpp=
=E2=80=99s 1.0 release caps a period of steady growth for the project.</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">GitHub=E2=80=99s annual Octoverse report <a h=
ref=3D"https://info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qT=
z8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF4T5nR3bW69t95C6lZ3n_W2pxvSr3m55y8W5jRS4k6TLBHLW2=
zqd2K1T-mc_VphYMC6b2qDmN5WxZT64WlSyW1ywYRN67lyh7W8rWZs62TTWwYW74MP-c6TC855N=
4pDjll8BX6zW5hHW2H7_BHTcW28c6Hg3bH8FmW26B6kc49c2wTMhbw5TLG5sdW3MzYKZ96wg8wW=
4TXkT078ZXsMW3TPPS-55CXKmW12qRjZ5j0_-FW1wxbbV96YCQzW24wdbt8Yld7hW28dn8C174S=
yJVnnNby4vld7SW6kdFMJ55jFCvVS9DjF6S8tNGW5F2TPk4vz9X2N7_Vr2Vt5ppFW6rmPlv33NC=
zbW8Pvrjn1m6fg6W6W22PT5-z2_0N8VWxpdXL1-8W69g9pB9gYWR7N3WLxJdX3m21W40YfJR1s7=
RyKW3Dzn642jb2_xW2SfzYj91WJHsW5QfZmS64KLKcW7GRZP878ydXCf1MLq4804" style=3D"=
color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"Fa8Z5An/" target=
=3D"_blank">ranked llama.cpp fifth</a> among independent open-source projec=
ts for growth in contributors this year, and third in overall engagement.</=
p>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Development is constant. The project publishe=
d <a href=3D"https://info.deeplearning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV=
0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF5M3qgz0W7Y8-PT6lZ3pTW8hnHjx5czVP9W5lVfM67M=
cnD9W5BpWzy8fZlgtN3l1XK_HRsjXW6Rd9ZG6JZwp_W27DNMY8bF2-QW7GJnc72__HvdW4qtQ5F=
4TzH-TW6SqRFT6FMRrYW8HbgYq6rPS7GN12sJ20yJwQMW2wVxmL8P-y42N74cCbdJSHz3W1DbTQ=
51n4P6MW7mLsnv8T4mzcW97j6NZ2c8SppVLv0Zj1Q1XHkW1c6yv281LPvCW3tlGxn4S_nhbN4W8=
f0SscHlcVGw3mq6fcj-NW16zygx3ccP_tW5GhL723DCKHRW8GgNdx5j31tdVYBMV766xsv7W3SJ=
SYv5bCyZydVXqCC04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-li=
nk-id-v2=3D"6VS8Sa4Q" target=3D"_blank">50 nightly builds over November 15 =
and 16</a> alone, and version 1.0 arrived nine days after version 0.9.0.</p=
>
</li>
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Hugging Face, which the ggml team joined in F=
ebruary 2026, provides the project with =E2=80=9Clong-term sustainable reso=
urces,=E2=80=9D the team said at the time, and Nvidia, AMD, Qualcomm, Arm, =
IBM, and Intel supply hardware for self-hosted test runners, according to t=
he v1.0.0 announcement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> llama.cpp tu=
rned running language models from a data-center job into something a laptop=
 can do. That lets people and organizations <a href=3D"https://info.deeplea=
rning.ai/e3t/Ctc/LX+113/cJhC404/VX9XlS2DbV0TW8qTz8v7-Rf_WW8QwHkG5XSKyyN8rPF=
623qgz0W8wLKSR6lZ3n6W7hFXWC46WkMVW1JxWqn39Cvk5W1_Syyw20tJL8W4tj9G91Bs2VHW4q=
_sf05FrlNWM5x1nqGp98QW14fjxB1x200wW2srgVb46ZjgQW2NDJkw7xNfmBW1-pdbX6sT4lkW2=
gT4cK4k0dY4W4JBVwX2BWCJ3W4nXbMc65-lDRW4jYvDR27WFLxW4GRY1P5Hlfj-W5rdY4d2nQl1=
WV31FxN1HkmfbW6k5GMj8bJmN9W56MQDj3Df4tVW42mhy93KzgW6W6RYjjS5ySpFKN2MqrzGzvq=
7tN83q38q8CptKW6BwQcT9kcWDKW3wnnxJ8y8t0BW2l8D1N1lpRk8W7dphP57zMc22W1JV8-j6k=
txb-f30wHhz04" style=3D"color:#237b94" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-i=
d-v2=3D"xiSDBJbf" target=3D"_blank">keep their data</a> on their own machin=
es, consult AI without an Internet connection, and avoid paying a cloud pro=
vider for every token. Because so many tools now build on llama.cpp, the pr=
oject=E2=80=99s continued health matters to everyone who uses them, not jus=
t to its own developers.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>We=E2=80=99re thinking:</strong> Kudo=
s to llama.cpp=E2=80=99s founding team and its growing community of develop=
ers! Anyone who works on open source and open models can draw inspiration f=
rom their achievements.</p>
